---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Coopers Grass Fed Beef"
  description="Terms of service for coopersgrassfedbeef.com and all Coopers Grass Fed Beef share orders. Effective November 15, 2026."
>
  <section class="bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
      <nav class="text-[13px] text-ink/50 mb-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-pasture transition">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span>Terms</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold mb-3">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3rem)] tracking-tight text-ink leading-[1.1]">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-ink/60">
        Effective November 15, 2026 &middot; All times and deadlines in these
        terms are measured in <strong>Central Time (CT)</strong>, our local time
        in Amarillo, TX.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 text-[15px] text-ink/80 leading-relaxed space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">1. Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            These terms are between you and <strong>Coopers Grass Fed Beef</strong>,
            a family-owned business based at 3201 Barry Dean Dr, Amarillo, TX
            ("we", "us", or "our"). By placing an order, paying a deposit, or
            using coopersgrassfedbeef.com, you agree to these terms and to our
            <a href="/policies" class="text-pasture font-semibold hover:underline">Refund, Cancellation &amp; Fulfillment Policies</a>
            and
            <a href="/privacy" class="text-pasture font-semibold hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">2. Our products</h2>
          <p>
            We sell custom-cut shares of beef and pork from animals we raise or
            source locally. Every share is a <strong>made-to-order</strong>, perishable
            product. Packaged weights are estimates; normal variation between
            animals is not a defect.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">3. Orders, deposits, and prices</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 marker:text-pasture">
            <li>
              A <strong>$500 deposit</strong> reserves your animal and locks in your price.
              Your order is not confirmed until the deposit is received.
            </li>
            <li>
              The remaining balance is due before your order ships or is
              released for pickup.
            </li>
            <li>
              We may refuse or cancel any order — for example, if a product is
              unavailable, pricing was listed in error, or we suspect fraud. If
              we cancel, you'll receive a full refund of anything paid.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">4. Payment</h2>
          <p>
            We accept Zelle, Cash App, Apple Pay, cash, and card payments
            through our secure payment links (processed by Stripe). You are
            responsible for providing accurate payment and delivery information.
            Card payments are subject to Stripe's own terms and privacy policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">5. Refunds, cancellations, and shipping</h2>
          <p>
            All refund, cancellation, shipping, and fulfillment terms are set
            out in our
            <a href="/policies" class="text-pasture font-semibold hover:underline">Refund, Cancellation &amp; Fulfillment Policies</a>.
            Those policies are part of these terms. Claims related to
            shipping damage, missing packages, or thawed meat must be made
            within <strong>24 hours of delivery (Central Time)</strong>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">6. Website use</h2>
          <p>
            You agree not to misuse the site — no scraping, no attempts to
            gain unauthorized access, no interference with how the site
            operates. Content on the site (photos, text, logos) is owned by
            Coopers Grass Fed Beef and is for your personal, non-commercial
            use only.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">7. Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the extent allowed by law, our total liability for any claim
            related to an order is limited to what you paid for that order.
            We are not liable for losses caused by things outside our
            reasonable control — incorrect delivery addresses, refused
            deliveries, boxes left unattended, carrier delays, weather, or
            similar events.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">8. Governing law</h2>
          <p>
            These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas, without
            regard to conflict-of-laws rules. Any dispute will be handled in a
            state or federal court located in Potter or Randall County, Texas.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">9. Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p>
            We may update these terms from time to time. The version posted on
            coopersgrassfedbeef.com with the latest effective date is the one
            that applies to your order.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about these terms? Reach us at
            <a href="tel:2542189863" class="text-pasture font-semibold hover:underline">(254) 218-9863</a>
            or
            <a href="mailto:Coopersgrassfedbeef@gmail.com" class="text-pasture font-semibold hover:underline">Coopersgrassfedbeef@gmail.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-block bg-pasture text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-pasture/90 transition"
        >
          Back to Home
        </a>
        <a
          href="/policies"
          class="inline-block bg-transparent text-pasture border border-pasture/30 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-pasture/5 transition"
        >
          Refund &amp; Shipping Policies
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
